# with Widevine, which their players need, and cage, which gives the browser
# the screen when there is no desktop. Without recommends, like the rest, so
# the Pi's Chromium tweaks (rpi-chromium-mods), the GPU drivers and the fonts
# that Chromium only recommends are named here. os/build.sh skips all of it
# with MP240_STREAMING=0.
chromium rpi-chromium-mods libwidevinecdm0 libgl1-mesa-dri fonts-liberation
cage
